  "主要内容": "The global Automotive Test Equipment market is estimated at US$2.2 billion in 2020, projected to reach US$2.8 billion by 2027, growing at a CAGR of 3.8%. The Passenger Cars segment is expected to grow at 3.9% CAGR to US$1.9 billion by 2027. The Commercial Vehicles segment is revised to 3.6% CAGR. The U.S. accounts for 28.86% of the global market in 2020. China is forecast to grow at 6.3% CAGR to US$493.5 million by 2027. Japan and Canada are expected to grow at 2.3% and 3.1% respectively over 2020-2027. Germany's growth is forecast at approximately 2.9% CAGR within Europe, with the Rest of European market reaching US$493.5 million by 2027. The report, now in its 8th edition, provides insights into the pandemic's impact on production and the buy side for 2020 and 2021, including a short-term phased recovery by key geography.",
